{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261122/photo/bkn-20261122083043310-1122_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261122115422\"/><p>佳翠苑行人路地底有水管爆裂。</p><p>小西灣發生爆水管。今晨(22日)7時05分，小西灣道16號佳翠苑近入口位置，行人路地底有水管爆裂，水流夾着沙泥，湧上行人路及行車路，車輛需減速涉水而行。執法部門接報到場，將受影響道路封閉，並通知水務署派員閂水掣及維修。據了解，涉事水管為鹹水管。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-22T04:02:42.569108+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":145,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-22T00:30:43+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-22T04:57:03.180144+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-22T03:56:16.953758+00:00","content_hash":"6d737487d00cf532cd0e764452bf53d818dbaca04c526b735256e06045c8b6f8","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}